# Local data — the corpus is fetched at run time, never committed (FR-032)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Committed on purpose: data/source_manifest.json and
# evaluation/golden_questions.json (source references and questions only).
# Anything that looks like publisher page content must never land here.
*.html
*.htm
!docs/**/*.html
crawl-cache/
.raw/
pages/
extracted/

